{"version":1,"content":"<p>長期以來，挪威、瑞典和芬蘭等北歐國家一直被認為是歐洲較為涼爽的地區，即使歐洲大陸遭遇嚴重熱浪，這些國家通常也不會出現特別極端的高温。然而，芬蘭氣象研究所的一項最新研究指出，40℃高温已經不能被視為北歐地區不可能發生的天氣現象。隨着氣候變化持續推進，這種極端温度出現的概率正在明顯上升。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584836.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.577917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:47:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"dcd6c18446a8e88a63ad683b2ca21c5c186c44f8f694ed992420668132b18b24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}